CrossOver Preview 20261015 / Wine 11.17: FIFA 17 CoreAudio fixes.
Rebased against the uploaded Preview 20261015 coreaudio.c and authorization.m.

- Optional WINE_COREAUDIO_EXCLUDE device-name filter
- Early capture authorisation using actual AVAuthorizationStatus constants
- Bounded (5s) permission wait, with a refcounted callback state
- Capture permission error returned before creating a HAL AudioUnit
- A guard for NULL AudioUnit in unix_is_format_supported

Source compatibility only. This patch still needs compilation and runtime
testing on CrossOver 27.0.0.41073. The CrossOver 26.3 patch is retained.

